# ==============================================================================
# NAME: Google All-in-One Complete Rule-Set (Google.list)
# DESCRIPTION: All Google Services, Registry TLDs, AI/Gemini, YouTube, GCP,
#              Firebase, Android/FCM, DNS, ASN & QUIC Optimization in ONE file.
# UPDATED: 2026-10
#
# HOW TO USE IN SURGE (Surge.conf):
#   [Rule]
#   # (可选) 如果在外部单独写一条 QUIC 阻断，或者直接取消下方第 0 节的注释配合 Sub-Rule 使用
#   RULE-SET,Google.list,Google
# ==============================================================================

